<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-EL GUERROUJ WINS WORLD MEN'S 1,500 METRES TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-EL GUERROUJ WINS WORLD MEN'S 1,500 METRES TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan Hicham el Guerrouj won the world men's 1,500 metres gold medal on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Fermin Cacho of Spain took the silver and his compatriot Reyes Estevez the bronze.</p>
</text>
